<view class="pg10-page badge-page" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px">
  <view class="pg10-header badge-header" style="padding-right: {{headerPaddingRight}}; top: {{statusBarHeight}}px"><button class="pg10-back" bindtap="back" aria-label="返回">‹</button><view class="pg10-header-title">Edit Profile</view><view class="badge-header-actions"><button class="badge-header-more" bindtap="toggleMore" aria-label="更多页面入口" aria-expanded="{{moreOpen}}">···</button><button class="badge-header-avatar" bindtap="goProfile" aria-label="返回我的页面">人</button></view><view wx:if="{{moreOpen}}" class="badge-header-menu" style="right: {{headerPaddingRight}}"><button bindtap="goPrivacy">隐私与安全　›</button><button bindtap="goActivities">活动记录　›</button><button bindtap="goProfile">我的页面　›</button></view></view>
  <view class="badge-status"><view><text class="muted-dot"></text>勋章系统尚未启用</view><text class="status-pill">待开放</text></view>
  <view class="badge-summary"><view class="summary-top"><view class="badge-orb"><view>✧</view><text>—</text></view><view class="summary-copy"><view class="summary-title">成长印记 <text>真实经历</text></view><view class="summary-description">勋章、等级与经验值尚未接入</view><view class="summary-next">✦ 真实活动记录可在下方查看</view></view></view><view class="xp-card"><view class="xp-row"><text>ϟ　当前经验值</text><text>待开放</text></view><view class="xp-track"></view><view class="xp-note">不会根据未经核验的数据授予称号</view></view></view>
  <view class="showcase"><view class="showcase-head"><view>♧　主页展示位</view><text>佩戴未开放</text></view><view class="showcase-slots"><view wx:for="{{showcaseSlots}}" wx:key="*this" class="showcase-slot" aria-label="勋章佩戴尚未开放"><view class="slot-icon">＋</view><text>暂不可佩戴</text></view></view></view>
  <scroll-view class="badge-tabs" scroll-x="true" show-scrollbar="false"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="badge-tab {{activeCategory === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-category="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectCategory">{{item.title}}</button></scroll-view>
  <view class="badge-grid"><button wx:for="{{visibleBadges}}" wx:key="id" class="badge-cell" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openBadge" aria-label="查看{{item.title}}概念说明，尚未授予"><view class="badge-circle {{item.color}}">{{item.icon}}</view><view class="badge-title">{{item.title}}</view><text>{{item.note}} · 待开放</text></button></view>
  <button class="badge-activities-link" bindtap="goActivities">查看我的真实活动记录　›</button>
  <view class="badge-bottom-bar"><view class="badge-share-note">概念预览 · 勋章与佩戴尚未开放</view><button class="badge-share-action" open-type="share" aria-label="分享勋章墙概念预览到微信"><text class="badge-share-icon">✦</text><text>分享勋章墙概念预览</text></button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{selectedBadge}}" class="badge-detail-backdrop" bindtap="closeBadge" aria-label="关闭勋章说明"></view>
  <view wx:if="{{selectedBadge}}" class="badge-detail-sheet"><view class="badge-detail-handle"></view><view class="badge-detail-top"><view class="badge-detail-icon {{selectedBadge.color}}">{{selectedBadge.icon}}</view><button class="badge-detail-close" bindtap="closeBadge" aria-label="关闭勋章说明">×</button></view><view class="badge-detail-title">{{selectedBadge.title}}</view><view class="badge-detail-category">{{selectedBadge.note}} · 概念预览</view><view class="badge-detail-notice">这枚勋章尚未授予任何人。评定、佩戴与单枚勋章分享尚未开放；本页只可分享概念预览，不代表你的活动已被认证。</view><button class="badge-detail-activities" bindtap="goActivities">查看我的真实活动记录　›</button></view>
</view>
